{"v":4,"catch":"與Satan展開一場決定性的戰役！唯有你能拯救地球！","desc":"《SATAN OF SATURN》是 SNK 於 1981 年推出的射擊遊戲。\n發射飛彈與雷射光束，擊落前來入侵地球的 UFO 與火箭。通關地球關卡後，便能飛往土星！在與Satan of Saturn的決定性戰役中取得勝利！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請欣賞成就一代電子遊戲的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2026-08-27","genres":["街機","射擊"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","義大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"保護級","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1962b25514f23efaa8925e62b6734fd6bdc36d2dfbba389fdcd9fe4cf3affa26.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/893a6e170112edefcd0081ab1221b8eec5100e2b08fdd983cf1c8f46985d4004.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b6b8b6a7834baceda161594255446143361e0f2be0ef5f1aa76125ce5edb3482.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/99de235e3c82c911dd52c126d6055436ab4e08373237c10903c458f59ecb929b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1b4430516cb3a3f6848a9826b5383680adebf237c1bc10c7b51eb63b2e9d7613.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4e4bba1acd97a2fa5f1e28924759f1324429852226d2c18ee5fc7a2c9b140a72.jpg"],"titleId":"01007dd0280b2000","dlc":[]}